{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1160,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] How do you fix a brain that's not working properly?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4580,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, until now the only real option has been to open up the skull,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8080,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "implant electrical or optical fibers, or even remove parts of the brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12780,
    "dDurationMs": 6580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you do something like surgery or ablation, even with ultrasound, that's an irreversible one-time procedure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19360,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this scientist has a different idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21800,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you wanna introduce yourself?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22740,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, sure. Yeah, I'm Mikhail Shapiro. Where should I look?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26620,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] You can look at me, yeah!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28200,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] Yeah, I'm Mikhail Shapiro. I'm a professor of chemical engineering at Caltech."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32660,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everything that we try to do is to make it non-invasive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36360,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning that we don't want to have any kind of surgery to open up the skull and implant an electrode,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42300,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or we don't want to have to open up the skull to shine light onto the neurons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46440,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We want to do it using sound waves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48340,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is one of the few forms of energy that can be focused deep inside of the tissue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53340,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and can actually permeate through things like the skull, even the human skull."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57000,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a curved transducer, so you can see there is a slight curvature in it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62380,
    "dDurationMs": 7240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that will cause the sound waves to get concentrated a few centimeters in front of the face of this transducer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69620,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] For now, the research is being conducted on mice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72620,
    "dDurationMs": 7340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the idea is to be able to turn on and off specific brain regions at will, without invasive surgery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79960,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] So the trick that we employ here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82360,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that we take something that's traditionally been a really big problem in neuroscience drugs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88300,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we turn it into an advantage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90420,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the problem is that the brain has what's called the blood-brain barrier"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94260,
    "dDurationMs": 7780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which lines the blood vessels of the brain and prevents molecules moving from the bloodstream into the brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102040,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] But in their procedure, they open the blood-brain barrier in carefully targeted regions of the brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107560,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] So to do this, we introduce little bubbles into the blood stream."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110760,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] Air bubbles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111780,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] Bubbles of air, but they are safe bubbles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115320,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is an FDA-approved clinically used-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119000,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] Like tiny bubbles?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120260,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] They're microns in scale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122160,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] Okay. Tiny air bubbles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123640,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] So tiny little air bubbles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125540,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we introduce into the into the bloodstream and so they're circulating everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129640,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then wherever we apply the ultrasound, the sound waves cause the bubbles to expand and contract in size,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136600,
    "dDurationMs": 6740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and as they're doing that they push against the blood vessel walls, and kind of massage them open."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143340,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they get that blood-brain barrier that's normally caused by really tight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146900,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "junctions between cells to open just a crack,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150380,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that now molecules can get out, into the brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153880,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] And by using the ultrasound you can target just specific areas of the brain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158520,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you want to open the blood-brain barrier and leave the rest of the brain alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161240,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] Exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162040,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] Once the blood-brain barrier is open, the scientists inject a specially made virus"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167420,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would normally not be able to pass into the brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170040,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] These viral vectors, which are viruses that we have hijacked,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174520,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that instead of them introducing their DNA to the cells,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177400,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're going to introduce the DNA that we want"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179640,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what this gene produces are these receptors that will go on to the neuron."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185160,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These receptors have been modified so they no longer respond"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188580,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to neurotransmitters that are natively present inside the brain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191620,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and will instead respond to a drug that we can inject"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194980,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that will activate just those receptors and not act on anything else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200860,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll tell you when we get to a part where your camera's going to get sucked into the magnet before it happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205880,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208860,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I appreciate that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210580,
    "dDurationMs": 6280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] So this big machine here is what generates the sound waves that we use."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216860,
    "dDurationMs": 6520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This little device will get installed on here, and then we're gonna have a mouse underneath,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223380,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then this entire thing is going to go into the MRI scanner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229060,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] Is this a special ultrasound for... mice?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233400,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] Both the MRI is special for mice, because as you can see from the bore that's in the middle of it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238400,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] Yeah. A human's not gonna fit in there!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240340,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] Yeah, well it'd have to be a really small human."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242300,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then our ultrasound system also is designed for these kind of small animals"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246480,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] And that squeaking sound that I'm hearing. That's not actually mice in there-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252440,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the MRI?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253380,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254080,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] How strong is the magnetic field in there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256280,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] Inside the scanner it's 7 Tesla."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259660,
    "dDurationMs": 660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] Whoa!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260320,
    "dDurationMs": 3770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] Yeah. So it's going to give us an image of the anatomy of the brain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264090,
    "dDurationMs": 3550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and allow us to target the focus of this ultrasound transducer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267640,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to precisely the part of the brain where we want to open the blood-brain barrier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271720,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Jerzy] There will be four bright spots that will appear on the brain just about here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275900,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is the opening of the barrier between the blood and the brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279700,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That allows a diffusion of what is essentially a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283520,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "magnetic resonance imaging dye that shows up during the MRI imaging."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287940,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the hippocampus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289280,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The hippocampus is a fairly large structure that's important in the formation of memory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293220,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this is the one that we targeted in our recent study to modulate the memory of mice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298080,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] We targeted the hippocampus,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300520,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is this part of the brain that's necessary for the formation of certain kinds of memories,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305100,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and using our technique, we can address just the neurons within the hippocampus,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310200,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when we give a drug those neurons get shut down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313420,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we can do behavioral experiments where we did a memory task,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317480,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where we put the mice into a particular environment and check to the next day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322180,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by bringing the mice back into that same environment whether or not they could remember it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326440,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for the mice that were treated with the ultrasound,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330000,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the receptors through the viral vectors, and given the drug that activates these receptors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334960,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that shut down the hippocampus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337360,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those mice were not able to remember,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342660,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we could tell that we were successfully able to inhibit or prevent memory formation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346280,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because the effect depends on when you give this drug, and how much of the drug you give,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349980,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can have reversible, turning on or off of the effect that you're trying to produce."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357800,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for example, shutting down the part of the brain that's causing a seizure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361560,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So another part of the brain that we're pretty interested in is called the ventral tegmental area,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366440,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is a part of the brain that uses the neurotransmitter dopamine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370060,
    "dDurationMs": 7680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and is involved in things like motivation, and addiction, and initiation and control of movement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377740,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if we can gain control over the neurons in that area,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382440,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it might someday be useful treatments for some of these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386740,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "motivational or affective disorders like addiction and our depression."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391420,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] Could you use this to control people's brains?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393600,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like by playing ultrasound, into some area?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396130,
    "dDurationMs": 3550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] No, there is not a chance, at least using our technology,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399680,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you could be walking around and we could be controlling your brain remotely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403920,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "... if that's what you're worried about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405800,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] Not yet, anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407560,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Mikhail] That is not our goal!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408820,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek] Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412320,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey, this video was supported by viewers like you on Patreon and by Skillshare."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416960,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Skillshare is an online learning community with thousands of classes in a wide range of subjects;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421760,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everything from video production and animation, to business, marketing, entrepreneurship, and more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426780,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the idea is they get actual experts working in their fields to teach these classes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431620,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, they have a class on animation by Kurzgesagt,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434560,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I personally found that class really informative and helpful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437480,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean who wouldn't want to animate like Kurzgesagt?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439860,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact in making the animations for this video, I worked closely with a professional editor and animator,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444780,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I was better able to do that thanks to taking this class."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447460,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now if you want to check it out, the first 500 people to sign up via the link below"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451220,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "get two months free and besides that it's less than ten dollars a month,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454820,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so definitely a worthwhile investment if you want to upskill in any of the areas they offer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459180,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That premium membership gives you unlimited access to any and all classes on the platform,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463840,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I should probably point out that this makes a great gift idea too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467220,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or just as a way to start the new year with some new skills and knowledge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470620,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I really want to thank Skillshare for supporting Veritasium, and I want to thank you for watching."
    } ]
  } ]
}
